## Runtime software

| Component | Version | License and source |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Three.js | 0.187.0 | MIT. The local bundle and [license](src/webgl/vendor/THREE-LICENSE.txt) come from the [upstream release](https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/tree/r187). |
| GSAP | 3.13.0 | [GSAP Standard No Charge License](https://gsap.com/community/standard-license/). |
| Lenis | 1.3.23 | [MIT](https://github.com/darkroomengineering/lenis/blob/v1.3.23/LICENSE). |
| simplex-noise.js | 2.4.0 | [MIT](https://github.com/jwagner/simplex-noise.js/blob/master/LICENSE). |
| GLSL simplex noise | Embedded functions | Ashima Arts and Stefan Gustavson. [MIT](https://github.com/ashima/webgl-noise/blob/master/LICENSE). |

Three.js is bundled from the published npm package using esbuild 0.28.2.
Trailing whitespace in shader strings is normalized. The export list is the list of Three.js classes consumed by `WebGLApp.js`.
Three.js r125, FBXLoader, and fflate were used offline to read the original
mesh. They are excluded from the deployed runtime.

