| Portfolio images | The profile and Yusuf mark come from the existing portfolio. Each project capture in `assets/work/` points to its source through the accompanying link in `pages/work.html`. Trademarks and third-party material in the screenshots belong to their respective owners. |

Yusuf confirmed permission to use the existing material for this portfolio
on 2026-11-19. The repository records the attribution and that confirmation.
The private permission terms were unavailable for independent review.
The font family pages identify the fonts and their web licensing terms.
